    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n17942" root="زكى" body-key="z">
    
      1 
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">زَكِىَ</span></b> , (K,) aor. <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">يَزْكَى</span>, inf. n. <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">زَكَاةٌ</span>, <i>i. q.</i>
<span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">زَكَا</span>, aor. <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">يَزْكُو</span>, as meaning <i>It increased,</i> or <i>augmented;</i> (Lh, ISd, K, * TA;) and <i>produced fruit:</i>
(TA:) and ↓ <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">تزكّى</span></b>  signifies the same. (K.) ＝   
    <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer1"> </span>-A2- 
Also <i>He thirsted.</i> (Th, K.)

